\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Example}
\title{Conductance on the cycle of 4 vertices}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{Take #{N=4} and #{\ell=1} in \ref{fdip-00DM}. The conductance
of one edge is #{\frac{4}{3}}. \ref{fdip-00DC} gives the
resistance #{\frac{3}{4}}, and #{\frac{4}{3}} is its reciprocal.}
